          %h2#references References
          %p
            The abstract concept of genus is due to
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Friedrich+Hirzebruch"} Friedrich Hirzebruch
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/genus+of+a+surface"} genus of a surface
            via the concept of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Todd+genus"} Todd genus
            introduced in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Arthur+Todd"}> John Arthur Todd
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em The arithmetical invariants of algebraic loci
              %p 190–225.
          %p
            An review of the history is at the beginning of (
            %a{:href => "#HirzebruchKreck09"}> Hirzebruch-Kreck 09
            )
          %p The theory of multiplicative sequences and characteristic series of genera is due to
          %ul
            %li#Hirzebruch56
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Friedrich+Hirzebruch"}> Friedrich Hirzebruch
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Neue topologische Methoden in der algebraischen Geometrie
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 9
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-662-41083-7"} doi:10.1007/978-3-662-41083-7
            %li#Hirzebruch66
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Friedrich+Hirzebruch"}> Friedrich Hirzebruch
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topological methods in algebraic geometry
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 131
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-62018-8"} doi:10.1007/978-3-642-62018-8
          %p Early review:
          %ul
            %li#HirzebruchGergerJung92
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Friedrich+Hirzebruch"}> Friedrich Hirzebruch
              , Thomas Berger, Rainer Jung, chapter 2 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Manifolds and Modular Forms
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 20
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-663-10726-2"} doi:10.1007/978-3-663-10726-2
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.maths.ed.ac.uk/~v1ranick/papers/hirzjung.pdf"} pdf
          %p Further review:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Serge+Ochanine"}> Serge Ochanine
                ,
                = succeed "?," do
                  %em What is… an elliptic genus
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/notices/200906/rtx090600720p.pdf"} pdf
            %li#HirzebruchKreck09
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Friedrich+Hirzebruch"}> Friedrich Hirzebruch
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthias+Kreck"} Matthias Kreck
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On the concept of genus in topology and complex analysis
                %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/notices/200906/rtx090600713p.pdf"} pdf
            %li#Hopkins94
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Hopkins"}> Michael Hopkins
                , section 2 of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topological modular forms, the Witten Genus, and the theorem of the cube
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.mathunion.org/ICM/ICM1994.1/Main/icm1994.1.0554.0565.ocr.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                Manifold Atlas,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://www.map.mpim-bonn.mpg.de/Formal_group_laws_and_genera"} Formal group laws and genera
            %li
              %p
                Wikipedia,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Genus_of_a_multiplicative_sequence"} Genus of a multiplicative series
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "wwwmath.uni-muenster.de/reine/inst/lueck/lehre/.../summary6."}
          %p
            Discussion in terms of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orientations+in+generalized+cohomology"} orientations in generalized cohomology
            and specifically for the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A-hat+genus"} A-hat genus
            and the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Witten+genus"} Witten genus
            is in
          %ul
            %li#AndoHopkinsStrickland01
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthew+Ando"}> Matthew Ando
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Hopkins"} Michael Hopkins
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Strickland"} Neil Strickland
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Elliptic spectra, the Witten genus and the theorem of the cube
            %li#AndoHopkinsRezk10
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthew+Ando"}> Matthew Ando
                ,
                = succeed "," do
